{"id":562,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"隣人愛と国際交流で自立を育む中高教育","feature_description":"茨城キリスト教学園中学校高等学校は、キリスト教の隣人愛を教育の根底に置き、心豊かで実力のある自立した国際人の育成を目指します。生徒の必要に応じた柔軟なカリキュラム、大学・地域と連携する探究、協力性を育む行事、留学や国際交流の機会を組み合わせています。中高六年間を通して、他者を尊重しながら自分の夢や目標を見つけ、実現に向けて進む力を支える教育です。","clubs":[{"id":10636,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10637,"name":"男子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10638,"name":"女子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10639,"name":"なぎなた部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10640,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10641,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10642,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10643,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10644,"name":"ワンダーフォーゲル部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10645,"name":"聖書部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10646,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10647,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.icc.ac.jp/ich/icjh_life/club/index.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07